## Appendix

### State Transition Diagram

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING: Order Created (paymentAttemptId: null)
    
    PENDING --> PAYMENT_INITIATED: initiatePayment (new attemptId)
    note right of PAYMENT_INITIATED
        paymentAttemptId: UUID v4
        transactionId: MOCK_TXN_{attemptId}_{ts}
    end note
    
    PAYMENT_INITIATED --> PAID: verifyCallback SUCCESS + Transaction Commit
    PAYMENT_INITIATED --> FAILED: verifyCallback FAILED
    PAYMENT_INITIATED --> CANCELLED: verifyCallback CANCELLED
    PAYMENT_INITIATED --> EXPIRED: 24 Hours Elapsed
    
    FAILED --> PAYMENT_INITIATED: initiatePayment (new attemptId, old invalid)
    CANCELLED --> PAYMENT_INITIATED: initiatePayment (new attemptId, old invalid)
    
    PAID --> REFUNDED: Admin Refund Action
    
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]
    REFUNDED --> [*]
    
    note right of PAID
        Purchase records created atomically
        User granted book access
        Unique constraint prevents duplicates
    end note
    
    note right of REFUNDED
        Purchase status changed to REFUNDED
        Book access revoked
    end note
    
    note right of EXPIRED
        Cannot complete payment
        Must create new order
    end note
```

### Order Status Transitions Table

| Current Status | Allowed Transitions | Trigger | Conditions |
|----------------|---------------------|---------|------------|
| PENDING (no attemptId) | PAYMENT_INITIATED | initiatePayment | Age < 24 hours, generates new paymentAttemptId |
| PENDING (expired) | — | None | Age > 24 hours, must create new order |
| PAYMENT_INITIATED | PAID | Payment verification success + transaction commit | attemptId match, age < 24h, verified=true, status=SUCCESS, all purchases created |
| PAYMENT_INITIATED | FAILED | Payment verification failed | attemptId match, age < 24h, verified=true, status=FAILED |
| PAYMENT_INITIATED | CANCELLED | Payment cancelled | attemptId match, age < 24h, verified=true, status=CANCELLED |
| PAYMENT_INITIATED | EXPIRED | Time elapsed | Age > 24 hours, payment rejected |
| FAILED | PAYMENT_INITIATED | initiatePayment (retry) | Generates NEW paymentAttemptId, old attempts invalid |
| CANCELLED | PAYMENT_INITIATED | initiatePayment (retry) | Generates NEW paymentAttemptId, old attempts invalid |
| PAID | REFUNDED | Admin action | Admin role, refund request |
| FAILED | — | None allowed (unless retried) | Terminal state until retry |
| CANCELLED | — | None allowed (unless retried) | Terminal state until retry |
| EXPIRED | — | None allowed | Terminal state |
| REFUNDED | — | None allowed | Terminal state |

### Failure Scenarios and Recovery

| Failure Scenario | Detection | Recovery Strategy | Data Consistency |
|------------------|-----------|-------------------|------------------|
| **Book deleted during fulfillment** | Book.findById returns null in transaction | Transaction aborted, order remains PENDING | Full rollback, user retries |
| **Duplicate payment callback** | Unique constraint on {order, book} | Duplicate key error (11000), treat as idempotent success | Consistent (constraint prevents duplicates) |
| **Concurrent verification** | Atomic update matched=0, or duplicate key error | First request succeeds, second treated as idempotent | Consistent (atomic + unique constraint) |
| **Partial purchase creation error** | Any Purchase.create throws in transaction | Transaction aborted, all changes rolled back | Full rollback, order remains PENDING |
| **Database connection lost** | Mongoose throws connection error | Return 500 error, log, user retries | No state change (transaction not started) |
| **Session expired during payment** | getCurrentUser returns null | Redirect to /login | Order remains PENDING |
| **Transaction ID mismatch** | order.transactionId !== callback.transactionId | Reject verification | No state change |
| **Payment attempt ID mismatch** | order.paymentAttemptId !== extracted attemptId | Reject verification "stale or forged" | No state change |
| **Stale payment attempt** | Old attemptId after new initiation | Reject verification "stale attempt" | No state change, latest attempt valid |
| **Expired order payment attempt (initiation)** | Age > 24 hours in initiatePayment | Reject with "Order expired" | No state change |
| **Expired order payment attempt (verification)** | Age > 24 hours in verifyPaymentCallback | Reject with "Order expired" | No state change |
| **Transaction commit failure** | session.commitTransaction() throws | Transaction aborted automatically | Full rollback, order remains PENDING |
| **Forged transaction ID** | UUID format validation fails | Reject verification "invalid format" | No state change |
| **Out-of-order payment attempts** | Attempt 1 completes after attempt 2 initiated | Reject attempt 1 (stale attemptId) | Consistent (only latest attempt valid) |

### API Contract Reference

**createOrderFromCart**:
```typescript
Input: {
  items: Array<{
    bookId: string;      // MongoDB ObjectId as string
    quantity: number;    // Positive integer, default 1
  }>
}

Success Output: {
  success: true;
  orderId: string;       // MongoDB ObjectId as string
}

Error Output: {
  success: false;
  error: string;         // Human-readable error message
}
```

**initiatePayment**:
```typescript
Input: orderId: string   // MongoDB ObjectId as string

Success Output: {
  success: true;
  transactionId: string; // Format: MOCK_TXN_{orderId}_{timestamp}
  paymentUrl: string;    // Route: /checkout/mock-payment/{transactionId}
}

Error Output: {
  success: false;
  error: string;
}
```

**verifyPaymentCallback**:
```typescript
Input: {
  transactionId: string;                        // Format: MOCK_TXN_{orderId}_{timestamp}
  status: 'SUCCESS' | 'FAILED' | 'CANCELLED';  // Payment outcome
}

Success Output: {
  success: true;
  orderId: string;
  status: 'PAID' | 'FAILED' | 'CANCELLED';     // Order status after verification
  transactionId: string;
}

Error Output: {
  success: false;
  error: string;
}
```

**getOrderDetails**:
```typescript
Input: orderId: string

Success Output: {
  success: true;
  order: {
    id: string;
    items: Array<{
      bookId: string;
      title: string;
      price: number;
      quantity: number;
      lineTotal: number;
    }>;
    subtotal: number;
    discount: number;
    total: number;
    currency: string;
    status: OrderStatus;
    paymentMethod: PaymentMethod;
    transactionId: string | null;
    createdAt: string;      // ISO 8601 format
    isExpired: boolean;
  }
}

Error Output: {
  success: false;
  error: string;
}
```

**checkUserOwnsBook**:
```typescript
Input: {
  userId: string;         // MongoDB ObjectId as string
  bookId: string;         // MongoDB ObjectId as string
}

Output: boolean          // true if ACTIVE purchase exists, false otherwise
```

